<title>USA: Azteca Holdings SA de CV sells $255 mln 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Azteca Holdings SA de CV sells $255 mln 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Azteca Holdings S.A. de C.V. was offered in the 144A private placement market on Thursday via Bear Stearns &amp; Cos Inc, according to a syndicate source.</p>
<p>BORROWER AZTECA HOLDINGS S.A. DE C.V.</p>
<p>AMT $255 MLN	 COUPON 11.00 PCT  MATURITY 6/15/2002</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SEC NOTES ISS PRICE 99.622  FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/1997 LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 11.10 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P B-MINUS	  SPREAD 475 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL THREE</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678</p>
